  <section class="section" id="baseline-specifications">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Verified Telemetry &amp; System Matrix</p>
        <h2>Scavland Tactical Quick Reference</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Core game architecture, Early Access baseline mechanics, and verified launch data audited for Build v0.5.169.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table class="facts" style="width:100%;">
        <thead>
          <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);">
            <th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;color:var(--acid);font:.75rem 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;">SYSTEM / DIMENSION</th>
            <th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;color:var(--acid);font:.75rem 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;">VERIFIED BASELINE (v0.5.169)</th>
            <th style="padding:10px;text-align:left;color:var(--muted);font:.75rem 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;">TACTICAL GUIDANCE</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">Release Status &amp; Pricing</td>
            <td><strong>Steam Early Access:</strong> $19.99 baseline (10% launch discount), released Sep 4, 2026.</td>
            <td>Build 25128670 active; no predatory microtransactions or battle passes.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">Gunplay &amp; Ballistics</td>
            <td><strong>25+ Firearms, 300+ Attachments:</strong> True muzzle velocity, bullet drop, and dispersion.</td>
            <td>Severe weapon jam failure below 50% condition; regular field cleaning mandatory.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">World &amp; Environment</td>
            <td><strong>Handcrafted Zalesye:</strong> Multi-level subterranean bunkers and dynamic toxic Mist.</td>
            <td>Mist causes filter wear and radioactive mutation storms; gas mask required.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">Faction Diplomacy</td>
            <td><strong>10 Interactive Factions:</strong> Daily 24-hour job pools and tiered barter vendors.</td>
            <td>Avoiding the 50% off-category sell penalty requires routing loot to specialized traders.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">Handheld &amp; Performance</td>
            <td><strong>Steam Deck Verified Baseline:</strong> Solid 60 FPS profile via custom 9W TDP limit.</td>
            <td>Yields 4+ hours of continuous handheld battery endurance.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--acid);">Multiplayer Architecture</td>
            <td><strong>Dedicated Solo Design:</strong> Hardcore singleplayer extraction sandbox at launch.</td>
            <td>Official developer roadmap includes prospective co-op squad extraction.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div style="background:var(--card-bg,#161616);border:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);border-radius:8px;padding:1.5rem;margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem;color:#fff;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Essential Wasteland Survival Directives</h3>
      <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.25rem;color:var(--text-muted,#aaa);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.7;">
        <li><strong style="color:var(--acid,#b9e86c);">Fast Extraction Looting:</strong> Use Shift+Click for instant inventory transfer to minimize exposed vulnerability at containers.</li>
        <li><strong style="color:var(--acid,#b9e86c);">Receiver Durability Threshold:</strong> Never enter high-tier military bunkers with a firearm below 50% durability to prevent fatal mid-firefight jams.</li>
        <li><strong style="color:var(--acid,#b9e86c);">Stealth &amp; Flashlight Discipline:</strong> Nighttime mutants track light beams and unsuppressed muzzle reports within an extended audio radius.</li>
        <li><strong style="color:var(--acid,#b9e86c);">Corpse Recovery Route:</strong> In Explorer Mode, backpack beacons remain persistent after death—clear surrounding perimeter before retrieval.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="codes">
